Subject: [PATCH 10/15] r4-prep B2: her frozen board copy carries the
 original's morph weights (apron/dress) and renderer state

Lead: the apron must not jump on the swap frame. mountBoardGuest (lakeside + meadow/sky city via withRegionBoardGuest)
now pairs original/copy MeshRenderers (SkinnedMeshRenderer included) by hierarchy order + node name and copies every
sub-mesh's every morph target weight (getWeight -> setWeights), enableMorph, shared materials and shadow cast/receive,
before and after the copy enters the scene. Joint pose already matches (blend mode, real joint nodes). Diagnostics:
guest.morph {renderers,morphRenderers,weights,mismatched}. Test: lakeside-board-guest (morph case).
